	<td width="100%" align="left" valign="top">
			<table style="BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: gold; BORDER-TOP-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: gold; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: ridge" height="100%" cellspacing="0" cols="4" cellpadding="5" width="100%" align="center" border="5"><tbody><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">10 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Nettleshield </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Protects the target group member by doing instant Divine damage to attackers when they successfully attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">11 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Chill </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Does instant Cold damage to the target opponent. (Does additional instant Divine damage if the target is Elemental) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">11.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Favor of the Phoenix </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Summons a Crystallized Phoenix Egg into the target party member&#39;s inventory. This egg can be used to revive a fallen priest. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">12 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Regrowth </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Major replenishment of Health over-time to a group member. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">13 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Subterfuge </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Area of effect hate reduction. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">13 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Bloom </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Instanly heals the target and increases health regen. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid/Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">13.4 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Spirit of the Wolf </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Increases the run speed of the target party member. (Does not stack with Pathfinding abilities) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">14.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Winds of Renewal </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Replenishes Health over-time to the group. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">15 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Mossy Balm </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Cures trauma effects. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">15.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Sylvan Touch </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Replenishes of Health over-time to a group member. This replenishment does not have a casting time, nor does it cost Power, but it has a significant re-use timer. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">16 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Sylvan Wind </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Group heal. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">16.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Vigor </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Increases the Power pool on the target party member. (Compatible with most Power pool augmentation spells) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">17 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Effloresce </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Instantly heals the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">18 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Wild Spirit </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Increases Agility and Arcane mitigations for all party members. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Elemental Amending </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Cures elemental effects. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Peerless Predator </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Grants a Lion form that increases Health and Power pools, increases Armor Class, grants See Hidden vision, and adds a chance for an additional melee special attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Faerie Fire </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Wreaths the target in a green glowing flame. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">21 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Feral intimidation </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Decreases the targets Strength and Wisdom. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Cyclone </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Deals magic damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">23 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Bristlepelt </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Damage shield. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">24 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Strike of Thunder </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Does instant Magic damage to the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">24 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Ferocity of the Eel </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Grants enduring breath and increased crushing damage. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">25 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Fierce Rousing </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Ressurects the target (can be used in combat) and gives a short heat proc to target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">26 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Savagery </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Augmentation that increases Agility and Strength on the target party member, and has a chance at an additional Melee attack and Slashing damage over-time on each successful attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">26 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Fleshweave </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Heals the target over time and grants a damage buff. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">27 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Confounding Brambles </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Area of effect hate reducer, also snares. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Breath of the Untamed </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Instant group heal. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Predatory Salve </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Instantly heals the target, increases agility, and grants lion form. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Rams Growth </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Group heal and defensive buff. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Vicious Feast </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Impairment that replenishes Health over-time and increases Stamina and Strength for the entire party when the target opponent dies. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Mark of the Hunt </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases the targets hit points, hit point regen, and speed increase when out of combat. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Natures Irate form </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Changes the form of the caster. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">30.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Verve </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increases the Power pool on the target party member. (Compatible with most Power pool augmentation spells) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">31 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Deadly Swarm </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Deals divine damage over time and decreases the targets defense. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">32 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Starburst </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Does instant Heat damage to the target and surrounding encounter members within the area of effect. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">32 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Untamed Spirit </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increases Agility and Arcane mitigations for all party members. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">33 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Savages Mask </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases the groups strength, agility, ac, and can add extra slashing attacks. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">34 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Transcendent Predator </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Grants a Lion form that increases Health and Power pools, increases Armor Class, grants See Hidden vision, and adds a chance for an additional melee special attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></