" background="textures/row3.jpg">Frostbite </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Does Cold damage over-time and decreases Elemental mitigation on the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">38.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Strike of Storms </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Does instant Magic damage to the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">39 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Pact of the Cheetah </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Increases run speed for a brief time for all group members. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">40 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Wild Bloodflow </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Grants a damage buff and regen. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">40.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Bloodlust </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Augmentation that increases Agility and Strength on the target party member, and has a chance at an additional Melee attack and Slashing damage over-time on each successful attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">41 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Ferocity of the Hunt </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases the targets hit points. Also increases HP regen out of combat. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">42 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Feral Tenacity </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Prevents death by healing at the target at the moment of death, also increases defense. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">42 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Howl of the Untamed </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Instantly heals the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">42 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Toxic Quills </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Reduces Hate towards the caster on successful attacks, also does instant Piercing damage with the chance at additional Poison damage over-time and an attack speed decrease for the attacker. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Fury </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">42 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Owls Restoration </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Group heal, also increases defense. </td></tr><tr><td va